]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:17:50-07:00","id":945563,"title":"","content":"You could argue that Pattern Restoration IS regeneration, modified by some Attainments.<br /> Still, I feel that Doctor mechanically fits a Proximus more than a full Mage; yet I agree that thematically, DRWho really highlights Mage's best sides (and accidentally, IMHO the most GM friendly model of telling Mage stories - traveling from Mystery to Mystery, without comfronting other Mages too often)<br /> <br /> EDIT<br /> Gallifrey is a society with small TRU MAGE ruling class that &quot;enslaved&quot; its non-mage population with magical boons and gifts of immortality, regeneration and other wondrous sparks of magic. By making them used to them, they control simply due to being able to say &quot;no more Regenerations for you&quot;, while being totally fine with going &quot;we will reward your bloodlust with extra chance at life, serve us&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","user":"WHW","date":". 08-07-2016, 02:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-07T11:19:56-07:00","id":945564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/945465-mages-are-like-time-lords?p=945545#post945545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arr